A||||8||Fiero*101||Is there anything behind that?||||1||
Z||000000||Fiero*101||12-27-2001||01:35 AM||||The pocket thing where most cars have the Glove compartments is there anything behind that?<P>A friend brought to my attention some kind of Mod to do but i wasnt sure if it can be done is there anything behind it?<P>Thanks for your time<P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar101.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Blacktree||12-27-2001||02:42 AM||||Behind the "pouch" there is maybe about 1.5"-2" of empty space. Behind that small amount of space, there is the air duct for the passenger side vent, some wiring, the little thing that goes *ding* *ding* when the door is open... stuff like that. If I remember correctly, the air duct doesn't cover the entire pouch area, just about the top half of it. Also, behind the ductwork there is even more empty airspace (the underside of the dash speaker).<P>(hint, hint) There's enough space in there to fit an amplifier for the dash speakers, as long as it's a small-sized amp.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tweaktech.com" TARGET=_blank>Tweaktech</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Standard||12-27-2001||03:20 AM||||Heater core is behind there, too.  Any mod to that area would require some serious surgery.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/quad_sig_pic_1.jpg">        <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000003||fierospeeder||12-27-2001||04:26 AM||||rodents and other unfriendly critters||||reg||1
Z||000004||LZeitgeist||12-27-2001||06:49 AM||||The factory subwoofer utilizes some of that space for the tube coming off the port in the enclosure.<p>[This message has been edited by LZeitgeist (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||1
