Z||000007||Fiero*101||12-27-2001||11:55 PM||||Ok thanks guys for the info<P>how would i go about on removing the pouch?<P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar101.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000008||mrfiero||12-28-2001||12:01 AM||||The "proper" way is to remove the dash.  The pocket is held on by 4 speed nuts.  If you don't care about the pocket you can just pull really hard on it until the plastic feet (where the nuts attach) break off.<P>||||reg||1
